WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.126 --> 00:00:05.049
(upbeat music)

00:00:06.176 --> 00:00:07.884
- Oh my God.

00:00:23.399 --> 00:00:25.860
(laughing)

00:00:27.196 --> 00:00:29.441
That is so good.
- I love you.

00:00:31.199 --> 00:00:33.025
♫ Gimme somethin' ♫

00:00:33.827 --> 00:00:35.579
♫ Without you ♫

00:00:35.579 --> 00:00:38.248
♫ I'm turnin' loose ♫

00:00:39.165 --> 00:00:41.126
♫ Gimme somethin' ♫

00:00:41.876 --> 00:00:43.420
- (beeped) it.

00:00:44.915 --> 00:00:46.923
Girl, pumpkin spice!

00:00:46.923 --> 00:00:49.125
Yay!

00:00:49.125 --> 00:00:51.469
It's pumpkin spice!

00:00:57.350 --> 00:00:59.135
Oh my God.

00:01:02.898 --> 00:01:04.774
Do you have like, that aren't gross?

00:01:04.774 --> 00:01:06.901
This is $50?

00:01:08.486 --> 00:01:11.698
Oh my God, yes, I could be an astronaut!

00:01:11.698 --> 00:01:13.858
Sexy crossing guard.

00:01:13.858 --> 00:01:16.487
Toucan? Yes, yes.

00:01:16.487 --> 00:01:17.904
Cross the street, okay.

00:01:17.904 --> 00:01:20.665
("We Wish You a Merry Christmas")

00:01:20.665 --> 00:01:21.959
Are you kidding?

00:01:21.959 --> 00:01:23.919
♫ We wish you a merry Christmas ♫

00:01:23.919 --> 00:01:25.882
It's October.

00:01:25.882 --> 00:01:27.547
♫ Good tidings we bring ♫

00:01:27.547 --> 00:01:28.715
This is a joke, right?

00:01:28.715 --> 00:01:31.134
It's not even Thanksgiving yet.

00:01:31.134 --> 00:01:33.804
♫ Good tidings for Christmas
and a happy New Year ♫

00:01:33.804 --> 00:01:35.138
Is anybody else hearing this?

00:01:35.138 --> 00:01:36.379
Is it just me?

